messages.content:
Build a sales overview control for Uno Platform (dark teal, Bricolage Grotesque, Figtree, Spline Sans Mono):
- a daily revenue heatmap of Q4 2026, 14 weeks by 7 days, in five steps of one hue with the thresholds in the legend; closed days outlined, missing days hatched, future days dashed;
- Oct / Nov / Dec / Q4: other months dim but stay in place;
- the period's revenue and its change (arrow, sign and colour together), the selected day's revenue, orders and change against the daily average, and the top three regions;
- hover or click a day; arrow keys move a day or a week;
- states Loading (everything keeps its size), No sales in filter (says so, never draws zeros, Clear filters) and Stale data (keeps the grid, says how old, Retry);
- a phone layout; a page with a Light/Dark switch and buttons to show the states; Hot Design previews of every state.

Stack: Uno Platform single project, MVUX, Navigation, Material, Toolkit.
